    "en": "is at equilibrium"
   },
   {
    "en": "proceeds in the backward direction"
   },
   {
    "en": "proceeds in the forward direction"
   },
   {
    "en": "stops"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 2,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "Q < K means products are too few; the reaction moves forward until Q = K."
  },
